{"id":"e_le_ment","lemma":"élément","pos":"noun","rank":2271,"glosses":["element (part of a whole)","element (chemical element)"],"ipa":"/e.le.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d6/Fr-%C3%A9l%C3%A9ment.ogg/Fr-%C3%A9l%C3%A9ment.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"éléments"},"formAudio":{"éléments":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f5/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Sartus85-%C3%A9l%C3%A9ments.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Vous n'êtes pas dans votre élément, ici.","en":"You don't fit in here.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Mélanger tous les éléments pour faire une seule pièce.","en":"Combine all the parts to make one piece.","words":[{"g":"to mix, to mix up"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"alone","l":"seul"},{"g":"room in a house, etc."}]},{"text":"C'est un élément nécessaire de l'équipement.","en":"It's a necessary piece of equipment.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"necessary"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"equipment"}]},{"text":"Passons en revue les éléments de preuve.","en":"Let's review the evidence.","words":[{"g":"to pass","l":"passer"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"magazine, journal"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"evidence, proof"}]},{"text":"Tu n'es pas dans ton élément, ici.","en":"You don't fit in here.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"are","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"here"}]}]}